UPDATE companies SET description='McCann Woodworking operates from a historic carriage house in downtown Morristown, New Jersey. Founded in 2010 by Mickey McCann, the business began as a small wood shop after McCann completed training at The Krenov School in Northern California, formerly the College of the Redwoods Fine Woodworking Program. The company is organized as a limited liability company.

The shop specializes in furniture making and antique restoration, emphasizing fine hand skills and a careful eye for harmony in design. McCann works as both designer and maker, producing custom furniture pieces and restoring antique items.

