UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 2016 by Rafey Zaheer in Glastonbury, Connecticut, Medzah Industries began as a minority-owned small business with a mission to transform healthcare supplies through innovation and eco-friendly practices. The company also operates a site in Dallas, Texas, and a second Connecticut location in South Windsor.

Medzah manufactures sterile disposables, including 3-ply face masks and the Bionex smart dispensing system designed to prevent cross-contamination. It assembles custom medical kits and provides third-party logistics (3PL) and supply chain solutions, drawing on a global sourcing network that spans the United States, China, Malaysia, Pakistan, and Vietnam.

The company serves hospitals, clinics, and home-care providers nationwide. Notable customers include Boston Children’s Hospital, which named Medzah its Supplier of the Month in September 2024, and the Greater New England Minority Supplier Development Council (GNEMSDC), which awarded Medzah its Supplier of the Year honor.

Medzah cites its commitment to sustainability, diversity, and innovation as core differentiators. The firm’s recognition as the 2025 Manufacturer of the Year for Connecticut and New England, along with a Firecracker Award and SBA nominations, underscores its focus on reliable, eco-friendly healthcare solutions.', certifications=ARRAY['Trusted Partner Certified','Industry-Leading Supplier','Supplier Diversity Program','Small/Minority Business Enterprise']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sterile disposable manufacturing", "Custom medical kit assembly", "3PL logistics and supply chain management", "3-ply face mask production", "Bionex smart dispensing cross-contamination prevention", "Global sourcing and procurement", "Medical equipment distribution"], "industries": ["Healthcare", "Hospitals", "Clinics", "Home health care", "Medical supplies"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Sustainable, eco-friendly manufacturing and distribution practices", "Comprehensive 3PL and supply chain solutions", "Custom medical kit assembly and sterile disposable production", "Global sourcing network across five countries", "Certified Small/Minority Business Enterprise with supplier diversity program"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2016 by Rafey Zaheer -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Glastonbury, Connecticut and Dallas, Texas -> /about-us", "Manufactures sterile disposables, custom medical kits, 3PL solutions -> /about-us", "Produces 3-ply face masks and Bionex smart dispensing system -> /", "Global sourcing from US, China, Malaysia, Pakistan, Vietnam -> /about-us", "Serves hospitals, clinics, home care nationwide -> /about-us", "Boston Children''s Hospital Supplier of the Month September 2024 -> /about-us", "GNEMSDC Supplier of the Year Award -> /about-us", "2025 Manufacturer of the Year Connecticut and New England -> /", "Firecracker Award and SBA nominations -> /about-us", "Core values: sustainability, diversity, innovat