ge-manufacturing-l.l.c./"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='merge-manufacturing-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Meritek Electronics Corporation is headquartered in Baldwin Park, California, where its North American operations center and distribution hub are located. The company has been active in the electronics component market for more than 30 years and maintains additional offices in Utah, Illinois, and Mexico City, as well as engineering, manufacturing, and logistics facilities in Taipei, Taichung, and Suzhou.

Meritek manufactures a broad range of circuit protection devices, passive components, semiconductors, and printed circuit board products. Its portfolio includes metal oxide varistors, TVS diodes, EMI suppression capacitors, spark gaps and gas discharge tubes, conductive polymer capacitors, PTC resettable fuses, and a variety of capacitors, resistors, diodes, MOSFETs, crystals, and inductors. The company operates ISO 9001 and ISO 14001 certified factories and holds UL, CSA, and VDE certifications on its power devices. It supports both surface-mount and through-hole packages, offers custom design engineering, and runs vendor-managed inventory and stock management programs from distribution centers in North America and Asia. Millions of parts are kept in stock for immediate shipment.

The company serves industries such as automation controls, instrumentation, automotive, energy management, HVAC, power supply (UPS, AC/DC, DC/DC), telecommunications and networking, IoT, industrial controls, infotainment, security, fire and safety, elevator controls, and lighting.

Meritek emphasizes on-time delivery, zero defects, and competitive pricing. It differentiates itself with a multilingual support team, rapid engineering responsiveness, global logistics and stock management programs, and large inventory availability. The company also provides VMI, logistic services, and prototyping support to address supply chain challenges.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 14001','RoHS','REACH','UL','CSA','VDE']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Circuit protection device manufacturing", "Passive component manufacturing", "Semiconductor manufacturing", "Printed circuit board product manufacturing", "Custom design engineering", "Vendor managed inventory (VMI)", "Stock management programs", "Logistics services", "Prototyping support", "New product introduction (NPI) support", "In-process quality control (IPQC)", "Statistical sample testing", "Incoming inspection", "Outgoing quality inspection", "Zero defects manufacturing standard"], "industries": ["Automation Controls", "Instrumentation", "Automotive", "Energy Management", "HVAC", "Power Supply (UPS, AC/DC, DC/DC)", "Telecommunications", "Networking", "IoT", "Industrial Controls", "Infotainment", "Security", "Fire and Safety", "Elevator Controls", "Lighting", "High Energy Protection", "Telecom and Data Transmission"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Cost reduction, short lead times, and quality products", "Multilingual team serving USA, Canada, Mexico, and Asia", "Fast engineering responsiveness to technical changes and quality needs", "Global logistics and stock management programs (VMI)", "Large inventory with millions of parts in stock"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Baldwin Park, CA -> db, /about-us", "Global locations in USA, Taiwan, China, Mexico -> /about-us", "30+ years of operation -> /about-us", "ISO 9001 and ISO 14001 certified factories -> db, /about-us", "UL, CSA, VDE certifications on power devices -> /about-us