UPDATE companies SET description='The company notes that for 185 years businesses have relied on its equipment for customized sewing solutions.

Today Merrow produces more than 360 models of production‑grade sergers and overlock machines, each hand‑assembled to tight precision tolerances. It also maintains a spare‑parts inventory covering roughly 600 legacy models, with components machined to 0.001‑inch tolerances and available for immediate shipment. A dedicated Stitch Lab lets customers send materials for custom stitch development; the company sews samples and returns them within 14 days, then ships the finished machine ready for production.

The machines serve a broad range of sectors: apparel (lingerie, women’s wear, activewear), home textiles (curtains, linens, blankets), technical textiles (geotextiles, filters, fiberglass, Kevlar), military and flame‑resistant gear, netting and mesh, and general industrial material processing. Customers cited include Fortune 100 firms, design schools, circuses, tailor shops, and named accounts such as Ramblers Way, Hoffman Embroidery, and ACME Mills.

Merrow emphasizes its hand‑built approach, the depth of its legacy‑parts program, and the Stitch Lab service as key differentiators. The company says its stitches bring visual impact, performance, and distinction to consumer products, and that it strives to go beyond expectations in customer relationships.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Industrial sewing machine manufacturing", "Spare parts machining and supply", "Custom stitch development (Stitch Lab)", "Dealer sales and service network", "Technical support and training"], "industries": ["Textile", "Apparel", "Home textiles", "Technical textiles", "Military", "Flame-resistant garments", "Netting and mesh", "Geotextiles", "Non-wovens", "Filters", "Foam", "Rubber", "Fiberglass", "Emblems and labels", "Activewear", "Kevlar products", "Industrial material processing", "Design education", "Entertainment (circuses)", "Tailoring"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Spare parts available immediately; Stitch Lab samples returned in 14 days", "tolerances": "\u00b10.001 in for spare parts", "built_on": ["Over 360 models of production\u2011grade sewing machines", "Hand\u2011built to precision tolerances", "Spare\u2011parts inventory for 600 legacy models machined to 0.001\u2033", "Stitch Lab returns custom\u2011sewn samples in 14 days", "Machines shipped sewn\u2011off and ready for production"], "facts_used": ["Location: Fall River, MA -> db", "History: gunpowder factory to knitting mill to sewing machine manufacturer -> /", "Over 360 models of production-grade sewing machines -> /", "Spare parts for 600 legacy models machined to .001 tolerances -> /", "Stitch Lab returns samples in 14 days -> /", "Serves industries including textile, military, home decor, lingerie, etc. -> /", "Customer examples: Ramblers Way, Hoffman Embroidery, ACME Mills -> /", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "The Merrow Sewing Machin