UPDATE companies SET description='Metal Creations operates from Lakewood, New Jersey, where it has spent nearly three decades designing and manufacturing custom marine products. The company runs a dedicated full-service marine fabrication facility focused on boat towers, T-tops, radar arches, and canvas work.

The shop handcrafts each item to the exact specifications of the customer’s vessel. Core offerings include custom boat towers, bimini tops, rod holders, leaning posts, instrument boxes, and canvas enclosures. In addition to fabrication, the facility provides welding, repairs, and powder coating with metallic color options. The company also stocks and sells a full line of sport‑fishing equipment, including outriggers, sourced from U.S. manufacturers.

Typical projects involve building elevated towers for sight casting, installing T‑tops on center consoles, and sewing custom canvas covers for weather protection.

