UPDATE companies SET description='Miami Valley Precision Incorporated operates from Miamisburg, Ohio, providing precision machined components to customers who outsource CNC machining. The company’s quality system meets the requirements of MIL-1-45208, with all measuring and testing equipment calibrated to MIL-STD-45662A.

