UPDATE companies SET description='Miami Woodworking has operated in Lebanon, Ohio for nearly 30 years. The business was founded by Ken and his wife Phyllis, whose warmth and care became the foundation of the company. The shop is identified as a family-owned woodworking shop, and Phyllis’s legacy is highlighted as a guiding influence.

