UPDATE companies SET description='Mid-South Medical Imaging, LLC, originally founded as Mid-South X-Ray in 1968, is headquartered in Flowood, Mississippi. The company operates additional branches in Birmingham, Alabama, and Memphis, Tennessee, serving healthcare providers across Mississippi, Alabama, Arkansas, Louisiana, western Tennessee, and the Florida panhandle.

