UPDATE companies SET description='Midwestern Energy Solutions, doing business as MW Energy DBA, is headquartered in West Burlington, Iowa, at 11208 143rd Avenue. The company provides electrical, HVAC, solar, generator, and roofing services to customers throughout Iowa, Illinois, and Missouri. No founding year or ownership details are disclosed on its website.

