UPDATE companies SET description='Mill Direct Textiles operates from Somersworth, New Hampshire, where it maintains an exclusive relationship with Polartec to supply fabrics without minimum order requirements. The company leverages this partnership to offer three distinct inventory tiers: Regular Stock items purchased as production runs, Limited Stock consisting of Excess First Quality and Merchantable Seconds, and Aged First Quality rolls held for more than two years and sold as-is at deep discounts.

